=== ROOM 52: THE OWNERSHIP VAULT ===

Files in the Ownership Vault have been scrambled - wrong owners
and wrong groups. The vault's mechanism checks ownership before
granting access. Fix everything to match the requirements.

MISSION:
1. Read requirements.txt to see what each file's ownership should be
2. Use id and groups to understand the available users/groups
3. Fix ownership: chown user:group file
4. Fix group only: chgrp group file
5. Set umask to 022: umask 022
6. Validate: ./getKey.sh

KEY COMMANDS:
   chown user:group file   Change owner and group
   chown -R user:group dir/  Recursive ownership change
   chgrp group file        Change group only
   umask                   Show current umask
   umask 022               Set umask (new files get 644, dirs 755)
   id                      Show uid, gid, groups
   stat -c "%U %G %a" file Show owner, group, octal perms

To decrypt room_53 when you have the password:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 \
     -in ../room_53/README -out ../room_53/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD
   cat ../room_53/README.txt
